        body: "<p>Next comes bloodwork. Providers handle this in different ways:</p><ul><li><strong>At-home test kits</strong> you use and mail back</li><li><strong>A local lab visit</strong> at a partner facility for a blood draw</li><li><strong>Uploading recent results</strong> if you already have qualifying labs</li></ul><p>Because testosterone peaks in the morning and a single reading can mislead, expect an early-morning sample and often a confirmatory second test. Providers like <a href=\"/trt/reviews/hone\">Hone Health</a> are built around comprehensive lab testing before treatment.</p>",
