      "In the TRAVERSE trial (New England Journal of Medicine, 2023), 5,246 men aged 45 to 80 with low testosterone and high cardiovascular risk were randomized to testosterone gel or placebo for a median of 33 months. Major cardiac events occurred in 7.0% on testosterone and 7.3% on placebo; testosterone did not increase heart attack, stroke or cardiovascular death.",
